Subject: [PATCH] Coordinate shared terminal owners across workspaces in the
 same window

Use the existing global close coordinator whenever several workspaces own the session, even if every handle is the originating window. Preserve the single-owner path and cross-window behavior. Add a same-window live-plus-pending regression requiring startup settlement, one session kill, both views removed, metadata completion and both workspace identities retained.
